id=pipa_pen_always_on
name=Pen always on (pens without Bluetooth)
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=Stefan-Atanasov
description=ColorOS 17 port for Xiaomi Pad 6 (v9+): pen input stays on for active pens without a Bluetooth link (Lenovo Precision Pen etc.). Stock (like HyperOS): only while a Bluetooth pen is connected. Costs a little battery. Uninstall + reboot = stock.
